  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="Tag57" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;1) None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2) On October 31, 2025, Plains All American Pipeline, L.P. (&amp;#8220;Plains&amp;#8221;) purchased an aggregate 55% equity interest in EPIC Crude Holdings, LP (&amp;#8220;EPIC Crude Holdings&amp;#8221;), which owns EPIC Crude Pipeline, LP (&amp;#8220;this filing entity&amp;#8221;), from subsidiaries of Diamondback Energy, Inc. and Kinetik Holdings Inc., for approximately $1.568 billion, subject to certain adjustments and inclusive of approximately $613 million of debt assumed. In a separate transaction, effective November 1, 2025, Plains acquired the remaining 45% equity interest in EPIC Crude Holdings from a portfolio company of Ares Private Equity funds for approximately $1.327 billion, subject to certain adjustments and inclusive of approximately $501 million of debt assumed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Subsequent to these two transactions, Plains now owns 100% of EPIC Crude Holdings (which we now refer to as "Cactus III Pipeline") and is the operator of record for this filing entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3) None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4) None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5) None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
