  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag132" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;On October 31, 2025, Plains purchased an aggregate 55% equity interest in EPIC Crude Holdings, LP ("EPIC Crude Holdings"), from subsidiaries of Diamondback Energy, Inc. and Kinetik Holdings Inc., for approximately $1.568 billion, subject to certain adjustments and inclusive of approximately $613 million of debt assumed. In a separate transaction, effective November 1, 2025, Plains acquired the remaining 45% equity interest in EPIC Crude Holdings, LP from a portfolio company of Ares Private Equity funds for approximately $1.327 billion, subject to certain adjustments and inclusive of approximately $501 million of debt assumed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Subsequent to these two transactions, Plains now owns 100% of EPIC Crude Holdings, LP (which we now refer to as "Cactus III Pipeline") and is the operator of record for the Cactus III Pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
